id="c55" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• ◉ activity final ends the whole flow; ⊗ flow final ends only that worker branch.&lt;br&gt;• The fork lets the HTTP response return immediately (202) while grading runs asynchronously (NFR-P2).&lt;br&gt;• Hidden test inputs/outputs never leave the Backend lane (NFR-S3).&lt;br&gt;• Statuses match the ERD enum: queued · running · tested · feedback_ready · failed." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fff9db;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="1600" width="440" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>